{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"Launch to an 80 km circular orbit with turn shape 0.55, using about 3385 m/s and leaving about 4530 m/s. Staging is capped at stage 2 so the heat-shield decoupler at stage 1 never fires.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":1,"vessel":"craft","name":"Launch to Kerbin orbit","intent":"Launch from KSC and circularize in an 80 km orbit","why":"First step of the Duna mission: a parking orbit to depart from.","target":"Kerbin orbit, 80 km circular","tolerances":"Apoapsis 80 km +/-5 km, periapsis above 75 km, eccentricity under 0.01","expected_delta_v":3385,"expected_duration_s":1500,"abort_conditions":["Periapsis would end inside the atmosphere after the ascent","Any block fails, or the craft loses a part other than by staging","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"fuel_margin","resource":"","direction":"below","threshold":20,"why":"Keep enough delta-v for the rest of the mission."},{"quantity":"periapsis","resource":"","direction":"below","threshold":70000,"why":"Warn if the final orbit would not clear the atmosphere."},{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Charge is only on the battery until the panels are out."}],"risks":["Boost stages 5 and 4 have thrust-to-weight below 1, so the ascent depends on holding the planned turn.","The stage_limit of 2 stops staging before the heat-shield decoupler, so the last stage must have fuel left for circularizing."],"custom_script_reason":"","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local res is launch(lexicon("target_ap", 80000, "turn_shape", 0.55, "stage_limit", 2)).
if res:success {
  set res to circularize(lexicon("at", "ap", "stage_limit", 2)).
}
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"Extending the four SP-L solar panels with a short 0 m/s custom script. It also clears the leftover 21.9 m/s node from the launch so the Duna transfer can plan its own. I assume the panels use the stock ModuleDeployableSolarPanel events.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":2,"vessel":"craft","name":"Extend solar panels","intent":"Extend all solar panels and confirm charge is not falling","why":"Panels are needed for power on the long coast to Duna.","target":"All 4 SP-L panels extended, electric charge steady or rising","tolerances":"At least 4 panels extended; charge not below 10 percent","expected_delta_v":0,"expected_duration_s":60,"abort_conditions":["No deployable solar panel module found","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Warn if power is draining instead of recovering."}],"risks":["Panel event names may differ from the stock ones, in which case none extend and the script reports failure."],"custom_script_reason":"No Building Block extends solar panels.","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local ec0 is ship:electriccharge.
local done is 0.
for p in ship:parts {
  if p:modules:contains("ModuleDeployableSolarPanel") {
    local m is p:getmodule("ModuleDeployableSolarPanel").
    if m:hasevent("extend solar panel") {
      m:doevent("extend solar panel").
      set done to done + 1.
    } else {
      if m:hasevent("extend panels") {
        m:doevent("extend panels").
        set done to done + 1.
      } else {
        if m:hasevent("retract solar panel") or m:hasevent("retract panels") {
          set done to done + 1.
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
wait 15.
local ec1 is ship:electriccharge.
local res is lexicon("success", done > 0, "reason", "", "panels", done, "ec_before", ec0, "ec_after", ec1).
if done = 0 { set res["reason"] to "no solar panel extended". }
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"The escape orbit passes Minmus first and leaves a heliocentric apoapsis of 16.9 million km, short of Duna's 20.7 million km, with a closest approach of 20.5 million km. I will coast out of Kerbin's sphere of influence (about 80,000 s) and fly the correction from the Sun orbit in the next sequence. I assume the Minmus pass is safe at a periapsis of 1429 km.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":3,"vessel":"craft","name":"Coast out of Kerbin SOI","intent":"Clear the stale node and coast on rails until the craft is in the Sun's sphere of influence","why":"The Duna correction can only be planned accurately from the heliocentric orbit.","target":"Craft in a Sun orbit, past the Minmus flyby","tolerances":"Body is Sun at the end","expected_delta_v":0,"expected_duration_s":90000,"abort_conditions":["Coast block fails","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Panels are out; a low charge means a problem."}],"risks":["The Minmus flyby moves the later Sun orbit, so the correction burn will be larger than for a direct transfer.","The Sun orbit may not reach Duna's orbit without a prograde correction."],"custom_script_reason":"A plain wait to a UT, with the stale node removed first.","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local res is coast(lexicon("until", 11570900, "stage_limit", 2)).
set res["body_now"] to ship:body:name.
if res["success"] and ship:body:name <> "Sun" {
  set res["success"] to false.
  set res["reason"] to "still in " + ship:body:name + " sphere of influence".
}
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"Lambert solutions for the next periapsis (UT 37233510) show a Duna encounter for about 46 m/s, with Duna arrival at about 43.2 million UT. I will coast about 24.7 million s and fly that burn: radial 13.33, normal -31.65, prograde -30.11 m/s, using the tof 6.0 million s solution because it has the lowest cost and arrival speed. I assume the Sun orbit is unperturbed, so the burn point matches the solver to about 1 s.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":3,"vessel":"craft","name":"Duna intercept burn","intent":"Coast to the second periapsis after the phasing burn and fly the small Lambert correction that puts the craft on a Duna intercept","why":"The phasing burn aligned the orbit so a transfer to Duna costs only about 46 m/s.","target":"Sun orbit with an encounter patch at Duna (arrival about UT 43.2 million)","tolerances":"Residual under 1 m/s; an encounter with Duna's sphere of influence exists","expected_delta_v":46,"expected_duration_s":24800000,"abort_conditions":["Coast or burn block fails","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"delta_v_used","resource":"","direction":"above","threshold":120,"why":"The burn should cost about 46 m/s; more means a bad node."},{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Panels are out; a low charge means a problem."}],"risks":["The Lambert aim point is Duna's centre, so the periapsis must be tuned in a later mid-course burn.","A phase error of a few seconds in burn time shifts the aim by a small amount, to be corrected later."],"custom_script_reason":"Interplanetary Lambert burn to a fixed UT; no Building Block covers it, so the solver's node values are added by hand and flown by exec_node.","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local tburn is 37233510.
local res is coast(lexicon("until", tburn - 900, "stage_limit", 2)).
if res["success"] {
  add node(tburn, 13.33, -31.65, -30.11).
  set res to exec_node(lexicon("stage_limit", 2, "max_residual", 1)).
  local enc is "none".
  if ship:orbit:hasnextpatch { set enc to ship:orbit:nextpatch:body:name. }
  set res["next_patch_body"] to enc.
  if res["success"] and enc <> "Duna" {
    set res["success"] to false.
    set res["reason"] to "no Duna encounter after the burn".
  }
}
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"Mid-course correction to move the Duna periapsis from the intercept's -320 km (an impact) to 100 km above Duna, then a coast into Duna's sphere of influence about 6 million s away. I expect the correction to cost under 20 m/s. Capture follows in the next sequence.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":3,"vessel":"craft","name":"Duna mid-course and approach","intent":"Tune the Duna periapsis to 100 km with a mid-course burn, then coast to just inside Duna's sphere of influence","why":"The Lambert intercept aims at Duna's centre, so the periapsis must be raised to 100 km to survive and be captured.","target":"Duna encounter with periapsis 100 km, craft inside the Duna sphere of influence","tolerances":"Periapsis within 20 km of 100 km; correction under 60 m/s","expected_delta_v":15,"expected_duration_s":6300000,"abort_conditions":["tune_pe fails or needs more than 60 m/s","Periapsis below 60 km at Duna","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"delta_v_used","resource":"","direction":"above","threshold":60,"why":"The mid-course correction should be small."},{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Panels are out; a low charge means a problem."}],"risks":["If the next patch is lost after the correction, the capture sequence will need a new intercept.","tune_pe may place the burn near the start of the coast, which is fine for a small change."],"custom_script_reason":"Two blocks need a small glue step to coast to the encounter time and check the body; no single block covers both.","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local res is tune_pe(lexicon("value", 100000, "patch", "next", "max_dv", 60, "tolerance", 20000, "stage_limit", 2)).
if res["success"] {
  local enc is time:seconds + ship:orbit:nextpatcheta.
  set res to coast(lexicon("until", enc + 60, "stage_limit", 2)).
  set res["body_now"] to ship:body:name.
  set res["periapsis_now"] to ship:orbit:periapsis.
  if res["success"] and ship:body:name <> "Duna" {
    set res["success"] to false.
    set res["reason"] to "not in the Duna sphere of influence".
  }
}
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"The first try moved the Duna periapsis to only -15 km, and the block refused it before any further correction. I'm retrying from the current orbit with a wider tolerance, aiming for a 110 km periapsis within 40 km, so the result stays above the 50 km atmosphere. The correction should again be well under 20 m/s.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":3,"vessel":"craft","name":"Duna mid-course retry","intent":"Raise the Duna periapsis from -15 km to about 110 km with a second mid-course burn, then coast into Duna's sphere of influence","why":"The first tune left an impact periapsis, so one more small correction is needed before arrival.","target":"Duna periapsis 70 to 150 km, craft inside the Duna sphere of influence","tolerances":"Periapsis within 40 km of 110 km; correction under 60 m/s","expected_delta_v":10,"expected_duration_s":3200000,"abort_conditions":["tune_pe fails or needs more than 60 m/s","Periapsis below 60 km at Duna","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"delta_v_used","resource":"","direction":"above","threshold":60,"why":"The mid-course correction should be small."},{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Panels are out; a low charge means a problem."}],"risks":["Time left to correct is about 3 million s, so a later retry remains possible.","The previous tune moved the periapsis by hundreds of km for 0.1 m/s, so this one is very sensitive."],"custom_script_reason":"Two blocks need a small glue step to coast to the encounter time and check the body; no single block covers both.","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local res is tune_pe(lexicon("value", 110000, "patch", "next", "max_dv", 60, "tolerance", 40000, "stage_limit", 2)).
if res["success"] {
  local enc is time:seconds + ship:orbit:nextpatcheta.
  set res to coast(lexicon("until", enc + 60, "stage_limit", 2)).
  set res["body_now"] to ship:body:name.
  set res["periapsis_now"] to ship:orbit:periapsis.
  if res["success"] and ship:body:name <> "Duna" {
    set res["success"] to false.
    set res["reason"] to "not in the Duna sphere of influence".
  }
}
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"The second tune left the Duna periapsis at 38 km, 2 km short of the tolerance and below the 50 km atmosphere top. The node is quantised in steps of about 0.03 m/s, which is worth about 47 km of periapsis from this far out. I'll coast to about 150,000 s before Duna's sphere of influence and tune there, where the same step moves the periapsis only about 5 km. The target is 110 km with a 40 km tolerance.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":3,"vessel":"craft","name":"Duna late mid-course","intent":"Coast to 150,000 s before Duna's sphere of influence, set the Duna periapsis to about 110 km, then coast inside the sphere of influence","why":"A late correction is far finer than an early one because the node steps are fixed.","target":"Duna periapsis 70 to 150 km, craft inside the Duna sphere of influence","tolerances":"Periapsis within 40 km of 110 km; correction under 60 m/s","expected_delta_v":2,"expected_duration_s":1700000,"abort_conditions":["tune_pe fails or needs more than 60 m/s","Periapsis below 60 km at Duna","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"delta_v_used","resource":"","direction":"above","threshold":60,"why":"The late correction should be tiny."},{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Panels are out; a low charge means a problem."}],"risks":["If tune_pe still fails, the craft would enter Duna's SOI with a 38 km periapsis, inside the atmosphere top.","Tune_pe may judge the burn point as too close to the sphere-of-influence change; 150,000 s should leave margin."],"custom_script_reason":"Glue step to coast to a point before the encounter, then tune and coast on; no single block covers it.","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local enc0 is time:seconds + ship:orbit:nextpatcheta.
local res is coast(lexicon("until", enc0 - 150000, "stage_limit", 2)).
if res["success"] {
  set res to tune_pe(lexicon("value", 110000, "patch", "next", "max_dv", 60, "tolerance", 40000, "stage_limit", 2)).
}
if res["success"] {
  local enc is time:seconds + ship:orbit:nextpatcheta.
  set res to coast(lexicon("until", enc + 60, "stage_limit", 2)).
  set res["body_now"] to ship:body:name.
  set res["periapsis_now"] to ship:orbit:periapsis.
  if res["success"] and ship:body:name <> "Duna" {
    set res["success"] to false.
    set res["reason"] to "not in the Duna sphere of influence".
  }
}
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"Capture burn at the Duna periapsis of 94 km: about 723 m/s to a circular orbit, with a burn time near 100 s. Stage 3 holds 778 m/s, so the last few m/s may come from stage 2, which the staging limit allows. The craft ends with about 2280 m/s for landing.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":4,"vessel":"craft","name":"Duna capture","intent":"Circularize at periapsis in a low Duna orbit","why":"Brings the craft into a stable low orbit from which to deorbit and land.","target":"Circular Duna orbit near 94 km altitude","tolerances":"Eccentricity under 0.01; periapsis above 60 km","expected_delta_v":723,"expected_duration_s":55000,"abort_conditions":["Circularize fails or the craft loses a part other than by staging","Periapsis below 55 km after the burn","Electric charge below 10 percent"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"periapsis","resource":"","direction":"below","threshold":60000,"why":"Warn if the post-burn periapsis would be in the atmosphere."},{"quantity":"delta_v_used","resource":"","direction":"above","threshold":900,"why":"Capture should cost about 723 m/s."},{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":15,"why":"Panels are out; a low charge means a problem."}],"risks":["Missing the burn leaves the craft on a hyperbolic escape from Duna.","The capture uses nearly all of stage 3 and may stage into stage 2."],"custom_script_reason":"","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local res is circularize(lexicon("at", "pe", "stage_limit", 2, "tolerance", 0.02)).
addons:claudia:report(res).","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}

{"kind":"sequence_plan","say":"Duna landing: I'm lowering periapsis to 20 km, then flying a retrograde suicide burn and a throttled touchdown. Budget is about 1000 m/s of the 2288 m/s left, with surface TWR 3.1. I'm assuming the site is whatever lies under the track, and I'm not waiting for daylight.","reply_intent":"none","unsure_because":"","sequence_plan":{"plan_step":5,"vessel":"craft","name":"Duna landing","intent":"Lower periapsis, coast down, burn retrograde at the right altitude and land on the Terrier with the legs deployed.","why":"The land block is airless-only and the reentry block would drop the engine stack, so a custom powered descent keeps the Terrier for touchdown.","target":"Touchdown on Duna at 5 m/s or less, anywhere.","tolerances":"Landed status, touchdown speed under 8 m/s, pod intact.","expected_delta_v":1000,"expected_duration_s":4000,"abort_conditions":["tune_pe fails: report and stay in orbit","delta_v_left below 150 before touchdown"],"telemetry_checks":[{"quantity":"delta_v_left","resource":"","direction":"below","threshold":150,"why":"Keep margin for a safe touchdown."},{"quantity":"resource","resource":"ElectricCharge","direction":"below","threshold":10,"why":"Keep power for the guidance computer."}],"risks":["Burn may start early because the suicide-burn estimate uses total speed.","Unknown terrain slope at the touchdown point.","Daylight is not checked, so the landing may be at night."],"custom_script_reason":"No block lands on an airless-style powered descent through Duna's thin atmosphere with the engine kept.","due_time_ut":-1,"window_closes_ut":-1,"late_window_dv":-1,"script":"local stale is allnodes.
for nd in stale { remove nd. }
local res is tune_pe(lexicon("value", 20000, "max_dv", 150, "stage_limit", 2, "tolerance", 3000)).
if not res:success {
  addons:claudia:report(res).
} else {
  local c is coast(lexicon("until", time:seconds + eta:periapsis - 500, "stage_limit", 2)).
  for e in ship:engines { if not e:ignition { e:activate. } }
  local thr is 0.
  local burning is false.
  local legsOn is false.
  local soft is false.
  lock throttle to thr.
  lock steering to srfretrograde.
  until ship:status = "LANDED" or ship:status = "SPLASHED" {
    local spd is ship:velocity:surface:mag.
    local hgt is alt:radar.
    local grav is body:mu / (body:radius + ship:altitude)^2.
    local amax is ship:maxthrust / ship:mass.
    if hgt < 2500 and not legsOn {
      legs on.
      set legsOn to true.
    }
    if spd < 35 and burning {
      if not soft {
        lock steering to up.
        set soft to true.
      }
      local tvs is -1 * min(60, max(2, hgt / 8)).
      set thr to max(0, min(1, grav * ship:mass / max(ship:maxthrust, 1) + 0.3 * (tvs - ship:verticalspeed))).
    } else if amax > grav * 1.2 {
      local stopd is spd * spd / (2 * (amax - grav)) * 1.25 + 200.
      if hgt < stopd or burning {
        set burning to true.
        set thr to 1.
      } else {
        set thr to 0.
      }
    } else {
      set thr to 1.
    }
    wait 0.05.
  }
  set thr to 0.
  unlock throttle.
  unlock steering.
  addons:claudia:report(lexicon("success", true, "reason", "", "situation", ship:status, "touchdown_speed", ship:velocity:surface:mag, "lat", ship:latitude, "lng", ship:longitude)).
}
","manual":false},"debrief":null,"alert":null}
